literal relative imports were followed; package imports and aliases remain navigation, not an assertion of a complete dependency graph.\"},\"interpretation\":\"Returned source files are fresh read evidence in this run. Definition/manifest, services, instances and parents describe the actual Plugin, including custom project Plugins. References preserve available installed API and shared types; unknown/omitted detail is not evidence of an unsupported feature. Read relevant documentation sections on demand. This read grants no write/development/takeover authority. Application edits affect all instances using that application; use composition inspection for layout/instance changes.\"}}","role":"tool"}

