data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_2f0287ce399d44f0bd4850c1","messageId":"2e5a91d9-4bbc-46c1-8231-916552788c1d","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"36c363e12ba6996246332ad2d3bbc5bbfdac9b49524ff624ed4a3387b850a575\",\"query\":\"创建自定义插件 注册表 registry 生成\",\"total\":89,\"offset\":0,\"entries\":[{\"documentId\":\"public:development/create-plugin\",\"title\":\"创建自定义插件\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/create-plugin.md\",\"summary\":\"已有插件的属性和组合无法满足需求时，可以在项目中编写新的 React 插件。先到插件检查可复用能力；只需让 Creator 帮你新增功能时，见增加新的界面功能。 以下路径相对于生成目录，默认为 src/agent-ui/。 开发时可以直接复用会话操作、状态 Hook、服务、事件、子插槽和消息展示接口。先查公共能力速查，各项提供使用前提和代码示例；插件组件和业务页面的接口入口也在其中区分。\",\"sha256\":\"e1ab2ce129fe251b39a7fa05e9fe0af74f01eeb50f4b8ef372781cc5f928fbbf\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/create-plugin\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"创建自定义插件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/create-plugin\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s62\",\"title\":\"4. 更新注册并检查\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/create-plugin\",\"sectionId\":\"s62\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s9\",\"title\":\"1. 声明插件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/create-plugin\",\"sectionId\":\"s9\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"title\":\"插件开发接口\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/plugin-api.md\",\"summary\":\"项目插件由能力声明、组件和可选的服务生命周期组成。创建文件与注册步骤见创建自定义插件。修改已有官方插件外观时，先使用组件公开属性。\",\"sha256\":\"cd30e68bc788dd22fdccc937313217ed5e3c3816b86e84f9138f758709423720\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s240\",\"title\":\"自定义服务\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s240\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"插件开发接口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s50\",\"title\":\"插件定义\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s50\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-renderers\",\"title\":\"自定义结果展示\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/custom-renderers.md\",\"summary\":\"已有消息或工具结果需要不同的视觉结构时，在对应插件的项目入口中使用组件公开的渲染函数。保留原有消息名称、工具名称、运行状态，以及传给展示组件的当前消息或工具调用数据。 从自定义 AG-UI 事件开始接入新消息卡片时，见自定义 AG-UI 事件与消息渲染，其中包含事件格式、解析函数、插件注册与启用的完整示例。\",\"sha256\":\"1755a0b39145b093c5b9688528a8c591fe47c221fcbc0bf6bfe2684be972708a\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-renderers\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"自定义结果展示\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-renderers\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s41\",\"title\":\"工具结果与其他消息\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-renderers\",\"sectionId\":\"s41\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s7\",\"title\":\"示例：调整图表数值\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-renderers\",\"sectionId\":\"s7\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\",\"title\":\"自定义 AG-UI 事件与消息渲染\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/custom-ag-ui-events.md\",\"summary\":\"按步骤将自定义 CUSTOM 事件解析并显示为消息卡片。\",\"sha256\":\"76bc2c6aeaa63f8b7ee3cf1263bda6df5ec37ed63d9af83845e80d2b4c4daf12\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"自定义 AG-UI 事件与消息渲染\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s103\",\"title\":\"4. 注册并启用插件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\",\"sectionId\":\"s103\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s149\",\"title\":\"5. 检查结果\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\",\"sectionId\":\"s149\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/frontend-tools\",\"title\":\"前端工具与自定义工具 UI\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/frontend-tools.md\",\"summary\":\"前端工具让 Agent 请求执行页面动作，例如打开弹窗或填写表单。业务应用决定哪些动作可用，并提供执行方法；工具 UI 只显示参数、状态和结果。\",\"sha256\":\"550e6db69213972586b6cd11791825e70f39e2bd6dc2a0832e4f6b6ca832f142\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/frontend-tools\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"前端工具与自定义工具 UI\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/frontend-tools\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s13\",\"title\":\"宿主页面操作接入\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/frontend-tools\",\"sectionId\":\"s13\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/layout-and-composition\",\"title\":\"布局与插件组合\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/layout-and-composition.md\",\"summary\":\"Agent UI 把会话列表、输入框、附件、复制等功能做成了插件。你可以按需启用、调整位置，也可以把多个插件组合起来。 本页说明如何手动修改布局配置。界面排列、插件实例及组合保存在 app-ui.json 中，组件属性和渲染代码放在项目插件入口。 日常调整可以直接把需求告诉 Creator，见布局调整示例。自己编辑时，先找到下文的配置文件，保留现有实例 ID，再按需修改位置、尺寸和组合。\",\"sha256\":\"472d2f6ae3449c0e8c1ef05791cfaf3213aab0fcb226ba8eda9037c9ef804047\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/layout-and-composition\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"布局与插件组合\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/layout-and-composition\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s132\",\"title\":\"插件放置与组合\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/layout-and-composition\",\"sectionId\":\"s132\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s24\",\"title\":\"插件使用方式\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/layout-and-composition\",\"sectionId\":\"s24\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:guide/adjustments/mention-and-commands\",\"title\":\"自定义 @ 候选与 / 命令\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"Creator\",\"path\":\"guide/adjustments/mention-and-commands.md\",\"summary\":\"描述要搜索什么、选中后做什么，Creator 再检查已有能力和缺少的资料。以下是 2026 年 10 月 27 日的实际请求与结果。\",\"sha256\":\"609fde94dd8592db436dc82478f7cb7d0627348f3be879c011ec8e552273edd6\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:guide/adjustments/mention-and-commands\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"自定义 @ 候选与 / 命令\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:guide/adjustments/mention-and-commands\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\",\"title\":\"工程结构与修改入口\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/project-structure.md\",\"summary\":\"初始化后，Agent UI 源码默认放在 src/agent-ui/。以下路径都相对于这个目录；初始化时选择了其他目录，就在实际目录中找同名文件。 不同版本或历史工程的目录可能不同，先检查已有组件的导入和导出。官方插件通常由项目入口导入 npm 实现；已经接管的插件则引用本地实现。 新工程只生成布局中选用的插件入口，以及读取服务、传入数据和显示子插件所需的代码，添加插件时再生成对应入口。已经存在的项目入口会保留。 服务相关 Hook 统一放在 services/hooks/ 下：useConversations.ts、useConversationActions.ts 和按需生成的 useAu\",\"sha256\":\"d12f5d52751a6ac2fdd49c8a308ac1b080e59b0cf6076e91bbf7ffaa729b73db\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s25\",\"title\":\"根据修改目标选择入口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\",\"sectionId\":\"s25\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"工程结构与修改入口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}}]}],\"nextOffset\":8}}","role":"tool"}

